{"id":"57fbcf0c4946d61a","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-order.md","title":"可计算阶函数","display":"df-computable-order — 可计算阶函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-order","aliases":["43-df-computable-order"],"display":"df-computable-order — 可计算阶函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-order — 可计算阶函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\iff\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\le h(n+1)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\ge k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\iff\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\le h(n+1)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\ge k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里约定非递减且无界；不要求严格递增，也不要求h(0)&gt;0。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.4.1 Definition 10.4.3，印刷220，PDF240。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}(h)\\iff\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(h)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\le h(n+1)\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(n)\\ge k.","display":true}],"bytes":1158,"backlinks":[{"id":"59be57c107bd283a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $d:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{ComputableMartingale}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableOrder}$ 分别见 [[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-order]] — 可计算阶函数"},{"id":"ce78261af74de716","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-computable-martingale]]、[[43-df-computable-order]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}